        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1159ee19-db9e-3105-93b2-353c79952dcb",
                "word": "fabulation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c6f7a8eb-532a-4e37-85ae-ca4d7aaea571",
                        "entry_id": "1159ee19-db9e-3105-93b2-353c79952dcb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "fabulations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce06a2d6-67c2-3989-a698-2effe7a8a572",
                        "entry_id": "1159ee19-db9e-3105-93b2-353c79952dcb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Récit inventé et présenté comme véridique."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "419a8f3e-2e9e-48e1-8378-9d4f35680a19",
                                "sense_id": "ce06a2d6-67c2-3989-a698-2effe7a8a572",
                                "text": "Ce dont, pour ma part, je suis convaincu, c’est que les siècles passant, les fabulations religieuses s’effritant, la mentalité israélite se modifiera, se corrigera; la fusion s’opérera complète entre les Juifs et les enfants du pays où leurs ancêtres se seront fixés."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3282cd17-942f-4b26-946c-93479455aae7",
                                "sense_id": "ce06a2d6-67c2-3989-a698-2effe7a8a572",
                                "text": "Je ne crois pas avoir jamais été mythomane, c’est pourtant une fabulation qui sortit de mes lèvres."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c13792fb-b531-3d07-b762-1720fd25a7a6",
                        "entry_id": "1159ee19-db9e-3105-93b2-353c79952dcb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action d’inventer et de raconter un tel récit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b07c91e-f7ee-47fe-82b7-16094e3682cd",
                                "sense_id": "c13792fb-b531-3d07-b762-1720fd25a7a6",
                                "text": "Je ne suis pas certaine qu’à l’époque où j’ai commencé à me laisser aller à ces fabulations, j’aie déjà eu des flirts, embrassé un seul garçon sur la bouche."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b89dc283-dd9b-4582-8c57-d28779af2dac",
                                "sense_id": "c13792fb-b531-3d07-b762-1720fd25a7a6",
                                "text": "Défabulant les croyances, le poète restitue toute son étendue à la fabulation."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "516b4a66-963b-3866-bf52-b8bf8e2692bd",
                        "entry_id": "1159ee19-db9e-3105-93b2-353c79952dcb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Habitude pathologique de certaines personnes de raconter des récits imaginaires comme s'il s'agissait de faits réels et sans en avoir conscience."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "98da4df8-2ab6-4626-8597-d3db11004dc7",
                                "sense_id": "516b4a66-963b-3866-bf52-b8bf8e2692bd",
                                "text": "D'emblée le mécanisme du délire est fondé sur la primauté de la fabulation. La fabulation est un récit fantastique et extraordinaire construit par un sujet qui le raconte comme s'il s'agissait de faits exacts qu'il aurait vécus et non pas inventé."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4f5a44e-cc6b-4645-a152-3fb8633605f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "1159ee19-db9e-3105-93b2-353c79952dcb",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce06a2d6-67c2-3989-a698-2effe7a8a572",
                        "source_sense_description": "Récit inventé et présenté comme véridique.",
                        "target_lang_word": "fabrication",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fabrication",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53c931dc-ecc5-3379-ba96-1cb7c1dad483",
                                        "entry_id": "f4f99dd4-fd53-32de-94de-51d28c772a87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of fabricating, framing, or constructing; construction; manufacture"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f08415c-a60c-4d70-b338-830c7b3605c8",
                                                "sense_id": "53c931dc-ecc5-3379-ba96-1cb7c1dad483",
                                                "text": "the fabrication of a bridge, a church, or a government"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa5fedeb-17e9-3f2f-bb14-761aeca16bb2",
                                        "entry_id": "f4f99dd4-fd53-32de-94de-51d28c772a87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which is fabricated; a falsehood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c4699e2-2347-43ff-b4d6-bc812f13a99d",
                                                "sense_id": "fa5fedeb-17e9-3f2f-bb14-761aeca16bb2",
                                                "text": "The story is doubtless a fabrication."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "635df631-8e6b-4400-bc0e-9c574eb40ba2",
                                                "sense_id": "fa5fedeb-17e9-3f2f-bb14-761aeca16bb2",
                                                "text": "The conscious mind refuses to admit any failure to perceive, and puts in its place a series of rationalisations which are fabrications and distortions of the real nature of things."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e4cf070-be52-3fda-b2f8-59f29cb7f789",
                                        "entry_id": "f4f99dd4-fd53-32de-94de-51d28c772a87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of cutting up an animal carcass as preparation for cooking; butchery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e9df5ca-e468-4d35-8b1c-7fab311b6d44",
                                                "sense_id": "6e4cf070-be52-3fda-b2f8-59f29cb7f789",
                                                "text": "For many years meat fabrication was done by hand, with the butchers improving their craft with the advent of higher quality metals, knives, and tools. With the coming of the Industrial Revolution in the mid-1800s, meat processing changed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1524da0c-649e-49f6-bb70-6527791b8e10",
                        "source_entry_id": "1159ee19-db9e-3105-93b2-353c79952dcb",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce06a2d6-67c2-3989-a698-2effe7a8a572",
                        "source_sense_description": "Récit inventé et présenté comme véridique.",
                        "target_lang_word": "confabulation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "confabulation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46822fcb-c87e-3705-a8f8-ac3cc98d2c90",
                                        "entry_id": "778dd471-9db0-3290-9881-a2f89c0a6a31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A casual conversation; a chat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "663bfd51-f625-417c-bb77-0ca238028fd7",
                                                "sense_id": "46822fcb-c87e-3705-a8f8-ac3cc98d2c90",
                                                "text": "[…] Mrs Grantly was preparing herself for a grand attack which she was to make on her father, as agreed upon between herself and her husband during their curtain confabulation of that morning."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd7b9e4b-1248-4d8c-bdf1-437176a3e9cf",
                                                "sense_id": "46822fcb-c87e-3705-a8f8-ac3cc98d2c90",
                                                "text": "The schoolroom piano broke into all gruesome fancies; and when that failed there were confabulations in corners, with a sequel of one of them going out in the highest spirits in order to “come in” as something new."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30dc630a-2a65-4519-932a-aa5f3724b5d5",
                                                "sense_id": "46822fcb-c87e-3705-a8f8-ac3cc98d2c90",
                                                "text": "The vision had roused a host of other associations, and he sat looking with new eyes at the library which, for over thirty years, had been the scene of his solitary musings and of all the family confabulations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a7c2124-83b0-377b-b132-e356dce91d75",
                                        "entry_id": "778dd471-9db0-3290-9881-a2f89c0a6a31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fabricated memory believed to be true, especially in someone suffering from dementia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e0afe89-42d3-4d13-95f1-7c9b054bddab",
                                                "sense_id": "8a7c2124-83b0-377b-b132-e356dce91d75",
                                                "text": "For Örulv and Hydén, confabulation is ‘world-making’ (669). What the person with AD chooses to enunciate, ‘may capture something important in the way the person makes sense of his or her life and also make meaning-based connections’ (Hydén and Örulv 2009: 206)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ceb80b0-647c-447d-9aa8-44f722cda6b0",
                                                "sense_id": "8a7c2124-83b0-377b-b132-e356dce91d75",
                                                "text": "Segal said another characteristic of Trump’s questionable mental acuity is confabulation. “It’s where he takes an idea or something that’s happened and he adds to it things that have not happened.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0c6b9dc0-3012-4bd9-9431-4a528fdc8292",
                        "source_entry_id": "1159ee19-db9e-3105-93b2-353c79952dcb",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce06a2d6-67c2-3989-a698-2effe7a8a572",
